  ('5b61ce92-ec95-4191-8fda-334037a3909a','b33cf2ac-db64-4b07-944c-4951aa8f6ca2','MUJTABA','2026-05-08','Studied few international brands website related to sports, their content and appeal in regards to making of Company profile and write up.\n-Meeting with UA (better clarity of my jd)\n*Writeup task mentioned in Activities tab\n','Discussion with Asad related to Private label customers\nMarket visit \nAsk UA for access to Private Label sales dashboard','','2026-05-08 13:31:08.196355+00','2026-05-09 07:15:57.765462+00'),
  ('4439b23f-19c8-4c0c-be3d-a62c9199b9ce','b33cf2ac-db64-4b07-944c-4951aa8f6ca2','MUJTABA','2026-05-09','Visited Korangi customers for brief introduction and knowledge gathering.\n-Kamran Sports (Kamran Bhai)\n-Arif Sports (Arif)\n-Behram Sports (Ahsan Bhai)','','Kamran Sports- He is already selling MM ball, whereas he is buying ball from Rehman(Sialkot) for his private label. Lack of commitment with us is due to previous poor quality and performance. However, after engaging him on those defined parameters, he initiated a trial order of 1 carton of Vm72. \n\nArif Sports- Same problem identified, as to poor prior experience due to product quality adherence issues. This has further caused reluctance is giving our company any space. However, he has order 2 dozen for trial basis.\n\nBehram Sports- He throughout our visit seemed distant and claimed company falsify its quality claims and that the weight of the ball should be less. No commitment by him. In order to break some ice I have committed to send him FOC of 6 balls for his review.','2026-05-11 05:51:14.180351+00','2026-05-11 14:00:03.969652+00'),
  ('b7737035-5681-4253-b0de-b5f9947540ca','b33cf2ac-db64-4b07-944c-4951aa8f6ca2','MUJTABA','2026-05-11','-Studying customer with reference to weekly areawise, shopwise potential and catergorization of customers\n -Customer profiling and sales call planning \n- Discussion of Behram''s case with UA and to pitch him with H72 \n- Development of PL sales filters with help of UA\n-Meeting with UA:\n-- Focus on product development according to customer''s need i.e. Behram (Ahsan Bhai) - Send sample of H72 against the sample provided by Ahsan\n--Development and opening of LMTs with help of Abid Bhai (Distributor, Lighthouse)\n--Add Brand Ambassador to help in testing and quality enhancement of variants and also help in breaking ice with old and disgruntled customer\n','Customer entries in Private Label Sales \nMarket Visit to North Karachi\nIssuance of sample of VM72 and H72(if available)\nRequest for card printing and company phone number','','2026-05-11 14:10:49.418662+00','2026-05-12 10:07:40.271972+00'),
  ('0a9217b4-a4f6-44fe-8c39-7db420e93595','b33cf2ac-db64-4b07-944c-4951aa8f6ca2','MUJTABA','2026-05-12','Discussion with Asad about posting "Customer Name i.e Shop Name, Contact person and area" now onwards on WhatsApp group.\n \nPlanned for Today:\n-Market visit (North Karachi) - Intro to Customers, Studying market/customer potential, customer requirement, sampling and their feedback\n-Recieved 5 VM72 balls from UA with better quality for sampling (North Karachi)\n\n ','-Personally give samples to Ahsan @ Behram for testing (confidence building)\n-Remaining customer visit in Landhi/Korangi Territory  ','Poor quality in comparison to ball available in the market.\n-huge disparity in sample and actual product provided against order\nMarket potential is available for Karachi based manufacturer, since we provide better credit terms, facilitate in product returns and lead time. \n','2026-05-12 08:20:57.99715+00','2026-05-13 06:58:41.395987+00'),
